---
export const prerender = true;

import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Lending Policy" description="Our lending policy explains how we connect consumers with lenders and how offers are presented.">
  <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-4xl px-4 py-16">
    <article class="glass-card p-8 prose prose-slate max-w-none text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Lending Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mb-6">Last Updated: March 1, 2025</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-4 mb-2">We Are Not a Lender</h2>
      <p>SecureLoan is a free online lead generation and matching service. We are <strong>not a lender, credit broker, or financial advisor</strong>. We do not issue credit, make lending decisions, or determine eligibility. All lending decisions are made exclusively by the independent third-party lenders in our network.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">How the Matching Process Works</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>You submit a request form with basic personal and financial information.</li>
        <li>We transmit your information to one or more lenders in our network who may be able to serve you.</li>
        <li>If a lender is interested, they will present you with a loan offer including their specific terms, APR, fees, and repayment schedule.</li>
        <li>You review the offer with no obligation. If you choose to accept, you deal directly with that lender.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">Lender Standards</h2>
      <p>Lenders in our network are required to comply with applicable federal and state laws including the Truth in Lending Act (TILA), the Equal Credit Opportunity Act (ECOA), the Fair Credit Reporting Act (FCRA), and all applicable state lending regulations. However, we do not guarantee lender compliance and are not liable for the conduct of any lender.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">Responsible Lending</h2>
      <p>We encourage consumers to borrow responsibly. Before accepting any loan offer, you should:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Read and understand all terms, including the APR, total repayment amount, fees, and payment schedule.</li>
        <li>Consider whether the loan payments fit within your budget.</li>
        <li>Explore all available credit options before committing.</li>
        <li>Contact the lender directly with any questions about their offer.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">State Restrictions</h2>
      <p>Loan products are not available in all states. Lenders may decline to serve residents of certain states based on applicable laws. Nothing on this site constitutes an offer or solicitation to lend in any jurisdiction where such activity is prohibited.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">Contact</h2>
      <p><strong>SecureLoan</strong><br/>
      123 Financial District Ave, Suite 400, New York, NY 10005<br/>
      Email: compliance@secureloan.example.com</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
